DATA NOTICE

Recipe data imported into this project comes from multiple upstream sources
with different licenses. The database itself is a compilation of:
- MIT-licensed structured data (dpapathanasiou/recipes)
- CC BY-SA content (Wikibooks Cookbook, TheMealDB)
- Fair-use scraped web content
- Blood Type Diet internal data

Redistribution of the compiled database may trigger share-alike or attribution
requirements depending on the subset you extract. See docs/DATA_SOURCES.md for
per-source provenance and licensing guidance. Use for personal/research purposes
only unless you verify commercial eligibility per source.
